  "description": "This Skid Steer Quick Tach Conversion Adapter Plate, with a 9.84\" retractable cross brace and 4000 lb load capacity, is designed for heavy-duty use, offering a large flat surface for easy welding and installation.\nFitment\nUniversal Skid Steer Mount Quick Tach Conversion Adapter Plate is compatible with most Bobcats, Kubota tractors & loaders, and widely used in agriculture, industry, and construction.\nFeatures\n9.84\" Long Retractable Cross Brace: Compared to quick tach conversion adapter plate alternatives, our product is uniquely designed with a 9.84’’ telescopical cross brace, allowing for a wide length range of 34.45’’-49.21’’ to better fit your needs.\nStrong Load-Bearing: This Skid Steer Style Mount Quick Tach Conversion Adapter Plate is designed for heavy loads with a powerful load capacity of up to 4000 lbs. It’s made from heavy-duty material that will withstand temperate weather and tough environments.\nMeet Your DIY Needs: This quick tach adapter features a large flat surface to facilitate easy welding, allowing for easier installation Simply cut the tabs off of your bucket and weld them to the quick tach assembly.\nLarge Flat Surface Design: This quick tach adapter features a large flat surface to facilitate easy welding, allowing for easier installation to save time & bolster efficiency.",
